<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to ERP AI Platform</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-top: none;
            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1 th:text="${platformName}">ERP AI Platform</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <h2>Welcome, <span th:text="${userName}">User</span>!</h2>

        <p>Thank you for joining the <strong th:text="${platformName}">ERP AI Platform</strong>.</p>

        <p>Your account has been successfully created. You can now:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access all platform features</li>
            <li>Configure your profile settings</li>
            <li>Start exploring the dashboard</li>
        </ul>

        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>

        <a href="https://erpai.local/dashboard" class="button">Go to Dashboard</a>

        <p>Best regards,<br>
        <strong th:text="${platformName}">ERP AI Platform</strong> Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2024 ERP AI Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
